defaulted</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">           THEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> LEAST</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">deposit_amount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">list_price</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">max_ratio_bps</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">           ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> refund_amount,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">policy_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> presale_order o</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> presale_deposit_policy p</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">market</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">market</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">paid_at</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">date</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">effective_from</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">effective_to</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> OR</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">paid_at</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">date</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">effective_to</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">order_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>reason_code</code> 字段的价值在运营侧：它让&quot;为什么退&quot;可以被聚合分析，从而发现某一市场或某一政策版本的退款率异常。没有这个字段，退款就是一坨无法归因的资金流水。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>定金是唯一具有惩罚性的支付名目；订金与预付款天然应当返还，混用命名会导致退款争议。</li>\n<li>定金罚则双向适用，系统必须同时支持没收与双倍返还两种终局。</li>\n<li>定金比例上限应当建模为按市场与生效日期版本化的校验规则，而不是注释。</li>\n<li>欧盟远程销售默认有冷静期撤回权，预售不能以&quot;已投产&quot;为由拒绝。</li>\n<li>美国负面选项规则在 2024-2026 年间持续变动，合规判断必须按版本管理。</li>\n<li>众筹的资金返还是 all-or-nothing 结构的一部分，不是例外处理。</li>\n<li>退款决策应当是纯函数，带政策版本与原因码，可重放、可归因。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>定金如何进一步变成一份对商家的价格承诺，见 <a href=\"price-lock-demand-aggregation\">锁单价保与需求聚合</a>；未达标时的批量退款执行顺序，见 <a href=\"../crowdfunding-goal-risk/stretch-goal-threshold-refund\">达标/stretch goal/未达标退款</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"定金可退性与预付消费法规","id":"定金可退性与预付消费法规"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"定金罚则与金额上限","id":"定金罚则与金额上限"},{"level":3,"text":"定金罚则的双向性","id":"定金罚则的双向性"},{"level":3,"text":"比例上限的工程含义","id":"比例上限的工程含义"},{"level":2,"text":"跨境场景下的撤回权","id":"跨境场景下的撤回权"},{"level":3,"text":"十四天撤回权是默认值"